<title>ALGERIA: Final voter turnout inside Algeria 66.30 percent.</title>
<headline>Final voter turnout inside Algeria 66.30 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian state radio said on Friday that 66.30 percent of eligible voters inside Algeria cast ballots in general elections on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the figure did not include the turnout of Algerians who voted outside the country.</p>
